## SwipTurn Project Verification

### Aligned
- **Color palette**: Centralized in `constants/colors.ts`, brand accent #FF4422
- **Typography**: Clash Display + Satoshi via `constants/fonts.ts`
- **Touch targets**: Buttons 48–56pt minHeight, back/icons 48x48, category chips minHeight 44
- **Loading states**: ActivityIndicator used on swipe, explore, saved, profile, login, signup, preview
- **Error handling**: Login/signup show error text; profile has retry; job-detail handles errors
- **Navigation**: Expo Router, tab bar, clear onboarding flow
- **Responsive**: useSafeAreaInsets, Dimensions in swipe
- **Mobile-first**: Native app, touch-optimized

### Gaps to Address
- **Accessibility**: No `accessibilityLabel`/`accessibilityRole` on interactive elements — add for buttons, chips, tabs, links
- **CustomTabBar**: Hardcodes colors instead of `constants/colors.ts` — align with design system
- **Images**: Uses standard Image or none; consider `expo-image` for job/company logos when added
- **Analytics**: Not implemented — add when tracking user behavior is needed
- **Design docs**: No style guide or user flow diagrams — create when team grows
